  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 na-adabere n'ọrụ sọftụwia mepere emepe nke ndị mmadụ dere. Edepụtara ya ebe a n'ihi na AI emeghị ya.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 bụ ọrụ AI mepụtara kpamkpam.<\/0> Ahịrị koodu ọ bụla nke Orion-81 n'onwe ya ka e dere site na Claude Code, onye malitere ya na-eduzi ya. Ụgbọ ọ bụla, maapụ, akpụkpọ ahụ na ụda ọ bụla ka ngwa ndị Claude Code dere mepụtara. Onye malitere ya na-ekpebi ihe a ga-arụ; Claude Code na-achọpụta etu e si arụ ya. Ọba ndị mepere emepe ọ na-adabere na ha dị n'okpuru 'AI emeghị'. Otu ihe ka bụ nke emeghe, a na-egosikwa ya n'ihu mmadụ: <1>nyocha ikike<\/1> koodu egwuregwu nke sitere na ihe nlereanya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion malitere na 28 Septemba 2026 dị ka ihe nlereanya mbụ n'elu engine Quake III Arena nke mepere emepe (GPL), ya na ụgbọ sitere na Elite Dangerous dị ka mkpali ya. N'ụbọchị nke abụọ, koodu egwuregwu ahụ kwagara n'elu BuB, engine ọhụrụ e dere site na Claude Code; modul egwuregwu ahụ sitere n'ihe nlereanya mbụ ma a gbanwere aha ha. Ntọhapụ 0.3.0 nyere ụdị ụgbọ niile 16 ahụ ọhụrụ nke nke ha. Nyocha nrube isi n'ikike na-enyocha ma koodu ọ bụla ka sitere na GPL mbụ, na ma atụmatụ ụgbọ mbụ ahụ dị nso nke ukwuu n'ihe mkpali ha. Nyocha akpaaka nke myirịta nke koodu ahụ megide isi mmalite ihe nlereanya GPL bụ nke a rụrụ na 8 Ọktoba 2026, nyocha ọkachamara nke ihe ya na-adị otu na-aga n'ihu. Ihe ọ bụla sitere na ya ka a ga-edegharị ma ọ bụ mezie atụmatụ ya.",
