  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code bụ akara azụmahịa nke Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games bụ akara azụmahịa nke Epic Games, Inc. Blender bụ akara azụmahịa nke Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous bụ akara azụmahịa nke ndị nwe ha. Aha niile bụ nke ndị nwe ha ma a na-eji ha naanị ịkọwa ngwaahịa a na-ekwu maka ha. Orion-81 enweghị njikọ, nkwado ma ọ bụ ndabere sitere n'aka ha ọ bụla.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Olileanya naanị. Enweghị mmekọrịta ọrụ, njikọ ma ọ bụ nkwado dị.",
