  "footer.notLiveYet": "Adịbeghị ndụ",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Otu ihe ka bụ nke emeghe: <0>nyocha ikike<\/0> nke koodu egwuregwu nke sitere na ihe nlereanya GPL. Nyocha akpaaka nke myirịta nke koodu ahụ megide isi mmalite ihe nlereanya bụ nke a rụrụ na <1/>, nyocha ọkachamara nke ihe ya na-adị otu na-aga n'ihu.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 bụ ọrụ AI mepụtara kpamkpam.<\/0> Koodu Orion-81 n'onwe ya sitere na Claude Code, onye malitere ya na-eduzi ya; ụgbọ, maapụ, akpụkpọ ahụ na ụda ka ngwa Claude Code dere mepụtara. Ọba mepere emepe ọ na-eji dị n'okpuru <1>'AI emeghị'<\/1>.",
